  "title": "STERIS Announces Dividend of $0.63 per share",
  "summary": "DUBLIN, IRELAND , Oct. 29, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STERIS plc (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” or the “Company”) announced today that the Company will distribute a quarterly dividend of $0.63 per share. The dividend is payable on December 18, 2025 , to shareholders of record at the close of business on",
